 "text": "Home\nWhat's On\nEvents\nAutumn Days\nAutumn Days at Filoli\nTickets start at $39\nFall photo-ops all across the estate\nVisit the Autumn Railway in the Redwoods\nEnjoy seasonal sips and treats, like apple cider, at our bars and café\nFree entry for members \nCrisp Air. Golden Light. Pumpkins Everywhere!\nAutumn transforms Filoli into a celebration of the season, where golden light, vibrant foliage, and harvest displays invite you to slow down and enjoy the changing landscape.\nStroll through the Garden to discover pumpkins, giant gourds, scarecrows, ornamental grasses, and a vintage red pickup truck that sets the perfect backdrop for your Autumn reels. Then step inside the historic House to experience it's unique warm, timeless beauty.\nBefore you leave, sip warm apple cider, enjoy seasonal treats, and capture a few unforgettable fall memories along the way.\nExperience the Delightfully Spooky World of the Bay Area\n Learn More\nFamily Fun All Fall Long\nSoak up all the colors, textures, and picture-perfect moments of fall at Filoli. Wander through golden grasses and vibrant autumn displays, explore the Autumn Railway, and get lost (just a little) in the Hay Maze.\nMeet the quirky characters of the Scarecrow Field and choose your favorite pumpkin-headed scarecrow. Pose by the vintage Pumpkin Truck, explore the Pumpkin Meadow, and capture those perfect family fall photos against one of the Bay Area’s most beautiful autumn backdrops.\nWith seasonal color around every corner and plenty for little ones to explore, Autumn Days at Filoli is made for crisp fall days, family time, and a camera roll full of memories.\nIncluded with your Admission\nAutumn Railway \nHay Play \nPumpkin Meadow \nPumpkin Truck \nScarecrow Field \nFall Foliage \nPrevious item\nNext item\nCalendar and Pricing\nFiloli Reserve Wine Tasting\nWhere every pour tells a story.\n Learn More",
